      "inspection": "Primary2012historic report pp97–99(physicalPDF107–109) text read; actual physicalpp108–109 rendered/inspected. Reinforced concrete Greco-Roman two-story central organ enclosure and Corinthian semicircular peristyle; pierced arch/large pilasters, shells/rosettes/urns/bulbs. Restored1979–1981; some concrete ornament replaced in reinforced plastic;1995accessible stage upgrade and1998lighting restoration. No proposed garage/landscape schemes authored."
    },
    {
