      "inspection": "Current aerial actually inspected. Main rectangular roof at south, two open curved wings sweeping north to short terminals; stage projects north, separate side stair approaches. Native combined U-shaped footprint matches; newer garden buildings/fountain/seating/trees/roads are distinct and excluded. Roof flat/shallow-fall metal panels, no dome."
    }
